sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant N as SOAP note
  participant X as AI Plan reader · Claude
  participant P as Context pool
  participant C as Plan composer · Claude
  participant V as Validator · rules
  participant T as Todo tables
  N->>X: AI Plan section only, de-identified
  X->>X: case = HTN, mode = custom, rule = walk 20 min daily
  X->>P: retrieve COPD runbook, doctor rules, guideline chunks
  P-->>C: P0 RULES and P1 rules with citations, action types
  X-->>C: P2 patient rules with quotes from the AI Plan
  C->>V: todo list as JSON, each step with bucket, threshold, source
  alt every step grounded and inside a bucket
    V->>T: write Table 1 todos and Table 2 monitor items
    Note over T: status Pending, outbound steps wait in ACTION_QUEUE
  else a step has no source or no bucket
    V->>T: status Needs clinician, show the ungrounded step
  end
